    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Esthétique Canin, on boulevard Paul Doumer in Le Cannet, in the greater Cannes area, is a professional grooming salon that also offers a self-service wash without appointment, under the "Lave Dog" brand. As with Dog Sit Home in Cannes, keep in mind this is not a pure standalone station: it is first a classic salon, with a self-service option added on.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The salon also offers classic professional grooming as well as the sale of accessories and dog food. It is open Tuesday to Friday from 9:30am to 5pm, closed Saturday, Sunday and Monday — more limited hours than most pure self-service stations. This information is cross-checked by PagesJaunes, Mappy, the official Facebook page and the dedicated website toiletteur-cannes-esthetique.fr, giving a good confidence level. Prices, however, were not found.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: check the opening hours carefully before heading over — unlike a 7-day-a-week terminal, this salon is closed on weekends and Mondays.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Le Cannet, on the heights above Cannes, is a few minutes from the town centre and the Croisette.</p>
